# CODEOWNERS
#
# SZL Holdings Platform — Code Ownership Declaration
# Each line maps a path pattern to its owner(s).
# Owners are required reviewers for pull requests touching those paths.
#
# Syntax: pattern  @owner1 @owner2
# Reference: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Reviewer policy
# ---------------
# Every rule below lists TWO code owners so that any single owner can author a
# PR and still satisfy the "Require review from Code Owners" branch protection
# rule via the other owner — without disabling `enforce_admins`.
#
# Owners:
#   @stephenlutar2-hash             — Founder / primary maintainer
#   @szl-holdings/platform-maintainers — Maintainer team (secondary reviewer;
#                                        currently aliases the founder + the
#                                        org's review bot, see CONTRIBUTING.md)
#
# When a maintainer authors a PR, the other owner (team or founder) is the
# required reviewer. Doctrine / citation / license maintenance PRs are
# expected to self-merge cleanly under this policy without admin override.

# Default owner — all files not matched by a more specific rule
*  @stephenlutar2-hash @szl-holdings/platform-maintainers

